{"id":"fa_cilmente","lemma":"fácilmente","pos":"adv","rank":1639,"glosses":["easily"],"ipa":"/ˌfaθilˈmente/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/1/1b/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-f%C3%A1cilmente.wav","examples":[{"text":"Cualquiera lo puede hacer fácilmente.","en":"Anyone can do it easily.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/461783","words":[{"g":"anyone"},{"g":"it / him"},{"g":"to be able to, can","l":"poder"},{"g":"to do"},null]},{"text":"Encontré fácilmente su casa.","en":"I found his house easily.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/932996","words":[{"g":"to meet","l":"encontrar"},null,{"g":"his / her / your"},{"g":"house"}]},{"text":"Él puede leer inglés fácilmente.","en":"He can read English easily.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/598101","words":[{"g":"he"},{"g":"to be able to, can","l":"poder"},{"g":"to read"},{"g":"English"},null]},{"text":"Puedes encontrar el banco fácilmente.","en":"You can easily find the bank.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/506332","words":[{"g":"to be able to, can","l":"poder"},{"g":"to meet"},{"g":"the"},{"g":"bank"},null]},{"text":"Podemos caminar hasta allí fácilmente.","en":"We can easily walk there.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/567288","words":[{"g":"to prune","l":"podar"},{"g":"to walk"},{"g":"until"},{"g":"there"},null]}]}